<title>USA: O'Sullivan Sept 30 Q3 shr declines.</title>
<headline>O'Sullivan Sept 30 Q3 shr declines.</headline>
<dateline>WINCHESTER, Va. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.10		    $0.17</p>
<p> Net		 1,547		    2,785</p>
<p> Sales	     47,553		   48,552</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  16,023		   16,511</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.62		    $0.66</p>
<p> Net		 10,012		   10,832</p>
<p> Sales	     167,119		  160,675</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  16,244		   16,502</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is O'Sullivan Corp</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said, as previously announced, third quarter results were hurt by losses at its Melnor Inc lawn and garden subsidiary and by production problems at the plastics unit, from contamination of a key raw material.</p>
